(6055019, 890907, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think the low camera angle doesn''t work as well as the original eye level version.  It doesn''t improve the image IMO, even though the background is effective.  Kudos on the wardrobe and poses.</td>', 'I think the low camera angle doesn''t work as well as the original eye level version.  It doesn''t improve the image IMO, even though the background is effective.  Kudos on the wardrobe and poses.', '2010-06-14 02:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
