(6055025, 889941, 62357, '<td valign="top">hopefully people take the trouble to find the original and don''t score you down.  I like this, it''s a good rendition.  Well done!</td>', 'hopefully people take the trouble to find the original and don''t score you down.  I like this, it''s a good rendition.  Well done!', '2010-06-14 02:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
