(6055249, 891131, 25355, '<td valign="top">Good thinking, but I think the real strength of the original cover photos was that it was a series of photos. You''ll alos probably lose points for the creasy background. ;-Þ</td>', 'Good thinking, but I think the real strength of the original cover photos was that it was a series of photos. You''ll alos probably lose points for the creasy background. ;-Þ', '2010-06-14 08:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
