(6055252, 891119, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I loved this whole series.  Fabulous.  The mother''s expression is spot on.</td>', 'Oh I loved this whole series.  Fabulous.  The mother''s expression is spot on.', '2010-06-14 08:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
