(6055254, 890382, 25355, '<td valign="top">The details are too sharp in comparison to the original, which really fooled many people (Arthur Conan-Doyle included, if I remember correctly) until one of the girls confessed a few years before she dies in old age. This wouldn''t fool anyone, but it''s certainly a good try. o;-Þ</td>', 'The details are too sharp in comparison to the original, which really fooled many people (Arthur Conan-Doyle included, if I remember correctly) until one of the girls confessed a few years before she dies in old age. This wouldn''t fool anyone, but it''s certainly a good try. o;-Þ', '2010-06-14 08:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6055255, 890325, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific tribute.  I loved how he used Fay and some of the other dogs on Sesame street.  All of his photos of the Weiemeraners are terrific, as is this.</td>', 'Terrific tribute.  I loved how he used Fay and some of the other dogs on Sesame street.  All of his photos of the Weiemeraners are terrific, as is this.', '2010-06-14 08:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
