(6063158, 891014, 76335, '<td valign="top">Most of Geddes''s shots make my teeth hurt. But this is a good imitation. In fact, I think I like what you''ve done here better that anything she does. Your colors are bolder, and it feels much more animated than most of what I''ve seen of hers. Nicely done.</td>', 'Most of Geddes''s shots make my teeth hurt. But this is a good imitation. In fact, I think I like what you''ve done here better that anything she does. Your colors are bolder, and it feels much more animated than most of what I''ve seen of hers. Nicely done.', '2010-06-20 11:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
