(6063371, 890352, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m judging these harder since there are so many of them. This is good, but one doesn''t get the feeling here of trial and trouble and (to my eyes) terror that one gets from the McCurry photo. She just looks sad. This is an excellent photo in its own right, but aside from the pose and headdress, it doesn''t in my opinion owe a whole lot to McCurry.</td>', 'I''m judging these harder since there are so many of them. This is good, but one doesn''t get the feeling here of trial and trouble and (to my eyes) terror that one gets from the McCurry photo. She just looks sad. This is an excellent photo in its own right, but aside from the pose and headdress, it doesn''t in my opinion owe a whole lot to McCurry.', '2010-06-20 17:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063372, 890919, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s a very harsh treatment and goes far beyond the subtelty seen in McCurry''s photo.</td>', 'It''s a very harsh treatment and goes far beyond the subtelty seen in McCurry''s photo.', '2010-06-20 17:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063376, 891090, 76335, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait but a bit too glamorous to bear any comparison to the McCurry photo.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait but a bit too glamorous to bear any comparison to the McCurry photo.', '2010-06-20 17:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063384, 891110, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. A nod to Jim in style and pose but still very much about the kid in the picture (who I''m pretty sure is not Jim).</td>', 'This is fantastic. A nod to Jim in style and pose but still very much about the kid in the picture (who I''m pretty sure is not Jim).', '2010-06-20 18:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063387, 891044, 76335, '<td valign="top">Erwitt redux. Rather nice.</td>', 'Erwitt redux. Rather nice.', '2010-06-20 18:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063465, 891086, 83876, '<td valign="top">Matched it great.  Very intresting had to look this one up and you did a great job on the look alike. 10   hope everyone else gets it</td>', 'Matched it great.  Very intresting had to look this one up and you did a great job on the look alike. 10   hope everyone else gets it', '2010-06-20 20:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063466, 890325, 83876, '<td valign="top">Had to look this one up. very intresting once I found what I was looking for. Uniquely done and hope that you get credit for that and people take the time to look this up. Nine from me because it''s looks like it''s a to altered to make black.</td>', 'Had to look this one up. very intresting once I found what I was looking for. Uniquely done and hope that you get credit for that and people take the time to look this up. Nine from me because it''s looks like it''s a to altered to make black.', '2010-06-20 20:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063488, 890910, 75618, '<td valign="top">Technically good but it''s cliche and you didn''t have anything that makes it stand out from other similar shots (except for the bold NG yellow border, which I love =P). 6</td>', 'Technically good but it''s cliche and you didn''t have anything that makes it stand out from other similar shots (except for the bold NG yellow border, which I love =P). 6', '2010-06-20 20:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063497, 889444, 75618, '<td valign="top">Needs a little bit of tweaking, the tilt in the horizon is a little distracting and the area surrounding Earth is splotchy. However, I love the idea behind it (and I adore Toy Story =P ) so I''m giving you a very biased 8. =)</td>', 'Needs a little bit of tweaking, the tilt in the horizon is a little distracting and the area surrounding Earth is splotchy. However, I love the idea behind it (and I adore Toy Story =P ) so I''m giving you a very biased 8. =)', '2010-06-20 21:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063499, 889992, 75618, '<td valign="top">This is the best one among all the Einstein images in terms of image quality. 7</td>', 'This is the best one among all the Einstein images in terms of image quality. 7', '2010-06-20 21:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063501, 891087, 75618, '<td valign="top">Captures the mood in the original pretty well. I don''t like how he blends into the dark BG though. 6</td>', 'Captures the mood in the original pretty well. I don''t like how he blends into the dark BG though. 6', '2010-06-20 21:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063502, 890563, 75618, '<td valign="top">Technicals were better in the other similar shots, image looks very flat. I''m bumping you up a point for having the best hair haha. 6</td>', 'Technicals were better in the other similar shots, image looks very flat. I''m bumping you up a point for having the best hair haha. 6', '2010-06-20 21:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063503, 890896, 75618, '<td valign="top">Cliche (at least in the context of this challenge) but really well done. 7+1</td>', 'Cliche (at least in the context of this challenge) but really well done. 7+1', '2010-06-20 21:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063505, 889695, 83313, '<td valign="top">A Loch Ness duck! What a great idea, wish I''d thought of it!</td>', 'A Loch Ness duck! What a great idea, wish I''d thought of it!', '2010-06-20 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063509, 891121, 75618, '<td valign="top">It''s a decent shot but the thing I love about those milk commercials is that they portray the personalities of the models really well... and I''m just not getting that from this image. 6</td>', 'It''s a decent shot but the thing I love about those milk commercials is that they portray the personalities of the models really well... and I''m just not getting that from this image. 6', '2010-06-20 21:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063511, 889830, 75618, '<td valign="top">Good shot but I don''t like the banding, splotches and shadows in the background. 6</td>', 'Good shot but I don''t like the banding, splotches and shadows in the background. 6', '2010-06-20 21:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063515, 891082, 75618, '<td valign="top">Image quality is inferior to the original but I appreciate the effort you put into it. 6</td>', 'Image quality is inferior to the original but I appreciate the effort you put into it. 6', '2010-06-20 21:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063516, 891127, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog has question... How to open shiny metal fruit to get food? Grog try smashing with rock, but make mess. Food all over cave walls now. Thag laugh at grog for licking cave walls.</td>', 'Grog has question... How to open shiny metal fruit to get food? Grog try smashing with rock, but make mess. Food all over cave walls now. Thag laugh at grog for licking cave walls.', '2010-06-20 21:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063517, 891126, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, famous on DPC perhaps. Ok, I''ll give it to you.</td>', 'Well, famous on DPC perhaps. Ok, I''ll give it to you.', '2010-06-20 21:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063518, 891006, 75618, '<td valign="top">The composition is not working for me. It is too tight/boxy. 5</td>', 'The composition is not working for me. It is too tight/boxy. 5', '2010-06-20 21:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063520, 890912, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good work with duplicating the ripples. Might need to be grainier and blurrier to truly capture the feel of the original. I think, however, that this one will probably score the highest of the Nessie pics due to lacking that blurry, grainy, OOF look of the original.</td>', 'Good work with duplicating the ripples. Might need to be grainier and blurrier to truly capture the feel of the original. I think, however, that this one will probably score the highest of the Nessie pics due to lacking that blurry, grainy, OOF look of the original.', '2010-06-20 21:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063521, 890363, 75618, '<td valign="top">Great details (e.g. the direction of the shadows, footprints). I think shooting from a slightly lower perspective would have improved this one. 7</td>', 'Great details (e.g. the direction of the shadows, footprints). I think shooting from a slightly lower perspective would have improved this one. 7', '2010-06-20 21:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063530, 890871, 75618, '<td valign="top">Sorry if this is harsh but... very sloppy cloning job (gray circles), hot spots in the apple, obvious haloing... 3</td>', 'Sorry if this is harsh but... very sloppy cloning job (gray circles), hot spots in the apple, obvious haloing... 3', '2010-06-20 21:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063531, 890526, 75618, '<td valign="top">Image quality/light can be better. 4</td>', 'Image quality/light can be better. 4', '2010-06-20 22:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063535, 890381, 75618, '<td valign="top">LOVE the harsh shadows and strong contrasts created by the lighting. Good tribute, but most importantly GREAT photograph! 10</td>', 'LOVE the harsh shadows and strong contrasts created by the lighting. Good tribute, but most importantly GREAT photograph! 10', '2010-06-20 22:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063541, 891109, 75618, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonals created by the distinct layers. I feel like this is a bit of a shoehorn though. 6</td>', 'Nice diagonals created by the distinct layers. I feel like this is a bit of a shoehorn though. 6', '2010-06-20 22:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063544, 891086, 75618, '<td valign="top">It''s wonderful that you even got the make-up and eyebrows right. 7 =)</td>', 'It''s wonderful that you even got the make-up and eyebrows right. 7 =)', '2010-06-20 22:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063547, 891072, 68020, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot....one of my favorite all time pictures</td>', 'Awesome shot....one of my favorite all time pictures', '2010-06-20 22:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063548, 890303, 75618, '<td valign="top">The inspiration/original is definitely evident in your picture. Would have loved an "angrier" sky/clouds but GREAT image overall. 8</td>', 'The inspiration/original is definitely evident in your picture. Would have loved an "angrier" sky/clouds but GREAT image overall. 8', '2010-06-20 22:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6063551, 891024, 75618, '<td valign="top">Love the strong contrast and rays of light but there''s nothing really extraordinary/special in the landscape to grab my attention. 6</td>', 'Love the strong contrast and rays of light but there''s nothing really extraordinary/special in the landscape to grab my attention. 6', '2010-06-20 22:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
