(6067930, 891042, 38162, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by coryboehne:</b></div><hr/><i> Raising the Flag huh?  Well, this does reflect a happier time in America doesn''t it?<br/> <br/>good point.  sadly we seem to raise the flag too many times and never taken the damn things down!  we are still in japan and germany let alone the other 129 nations with usa bases.  please cut the people of our nation some slack, we never voted for empire.<br/> <br/>I think this is probably a treasure for the family, and I think it''s pretty darn nice too.. 8.. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by coryboehne: Raising the Flag huh?  Well, this does reflect a happier time in America doesn''t it? good point.  sadly we seem to raise the flag too many times and never taken the damn things down!  we are still in japan and germany let alone the other 129 nations with usa bases.  please cut the people of our nation some slack, we never voted for empire. I think this is probably a treasure for the family, and I think it''s pretty darn nice too.. 8.. ', '2010-06-23 16:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
